  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Operator Guide",
      "description": "Action guide is visible without opening panel tooltip. No Data means check scrape/exporter before assuming healthy zero.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [],
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## 이 화면을 보는 법 / How to read this board\n1. **Overall Status**가 빨강이면 구성요소 준비 상태와 scrape 상태를 먼저 확인합니다.\n2. 지연만 높고 오류율이 낮으면 vLLM queue, KV cache, GPU headroom을 확인합니다.\n3. 오류율이 높으면 upstream error, validation rejection, auth failure를 확인합니다.\n4. **No Data**은 정상 0이 아니라 exporter 또는 Prometheus scrape 문제일 수 있습니다.\n5. Dashboard and panel titles are English-only; PromQL labels stay ASCII/English.\n"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Overall Status",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: all services ready (min=1). Action Required/조치 필요: any service not ready (min=0). No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape/exporter. Uses min() so one unhealthy service turns the whole indicator red. See Component Readiness for per-service detail.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "min(overall_runtime_status)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "overall"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "Not Ready",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Ready",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "User Traffic",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: observed live headroom stays above 5GiB. Attention/주의: 4-5GiB means reserve is thinning. Action Required/조치 필요: below 4GiB requires load/context review. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape/exporter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{service=\"gateway\",route=~\"$route\",status_code=~\"$status_code\"}[$window]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "rps"
        }
      ],
      "options": {},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p95 Latency (5m)",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: < 5s. Attention/주의: 5–10s. Action Required/조치 필요: > 10s. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape/exporter. Uses recording rule model_runtime_http_p95_latency_seconds with fixed 5m window — not affected by $window variable.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(model_runtime_http_p95_latency_seconds{service=\"gateway\",route=~\"$route\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 5.0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10.0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error Rate",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: expected range. Attention/주의: review trend. Action Required/조치 필요: investigate owner/runbook. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape/exporter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_requests_total{service=\"gateway\",status_code=~\"5..\",route=~\"$route\"}[$window])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(http_requests_total{service=\"gateway\",route=~\"$route\"}[$window])), 1)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "5xx ratio"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "GPU Headroom",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: expected range. Attention/주의: review trend. Action Required/조치 필요: investigate owner/runbook. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape/exporter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "min(gpu_memory_headroom_bytes)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "headroom"
        }
      ],
      "options": {},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 4294967296
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 5368709120
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Scrape Health",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: expected range. Attention/주의: review trend. Action Required/조치 필요: investigate owner/runbook. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape/exporter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "min(up{job=~\"gateway|risk-adapter|vllm-runtimes|dcgm-exporter|cadvisor\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "min up"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Component Readiness",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: expected range. Attention/주의: review trend. Action Required/조치 필요: investigate owner/runbook. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape/exporter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "service_readiness_status",
